WEBVTT

1
00:00:32.958 --> 00:00:35.833
This chapter is Bhakti Yoga.

2
00:00:35.833 --> 00:00:37.958
In Chapter 11, the Vishwarupa

3
00:00:37.958 --> 00:00:39.375
Darshan Yoga,

4
00:00:39.375 --> 00:00:43.125
Arjun beheld Lord Krishna's cosmic form.

5
00:00:43.125 --> 00:00:47.000
A form that is grand and otherworldly.

6
00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:47.916
A form

7
00:00:47.916 --> 00:00:49.416
so awe-inspiring

8
00:00:49.416 --> 00:00:51.833
that to grasp and accept it

9
00:00:51.833 --> 00:00:54.625
is extremely difficult for a human being.

10
00:00:54.625 --> 00:00:55.833
For some reason,

11
00:00:55.833 --> 00:00:58.750
this form certainly fills one with wonder,

12
00:00:58.750 --> 00:00:59.750
but a person

13
00:00:59.750 --> 00:01:01.375
may not be able to adopt it

14
00:01:01.375 --> 00:01:03.541
for devotion.

15
00:01:03.541 --> 00:01:06.291
This is precisely Arjun's dilemma. 

16
00:01:06.291 --> 00:01:08.166
And so he asks,

17
00:01:08.166 --> 00:01:10.833
which form of devotion is more fitting,

18
00:01:10.833 --> 00:01:14.666
the formless and transcendent
form of Lord Krishna,

19
00:01:14.666 --> 00:01:19.291
or this personal form standing before him.

20
00:01:19.291 --> 00:01:22.750
This is a deeply fundamental question, because

21
00:01:22.750 --> 00:01:24.083
throughout the Gita so far,

22
00:01:24.083 --> 00:01:27.583
Lord Krishna has presented
Himself in many forms.

23
00:01:27.583 --> 00:01:28.875
In Chapter 10,

24
00:01:28.875 --> 00:01:29.875
Vibhuti Yoga,

25
00:01:29.875 --> 00:01:32.875
we came to know His divine glories and powers.

26
00:01:32.875 --> 00:01:36.333
Then in Chapter 11, His cosmic form was shown.

27
00:01:36.333 --> 00:01:37.000
So now

28
00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:40.541
Arjun's question sets the foundation

29
00:01:40.541 --> 00:01:42.250
through which Lord Krishna

30
00:01:42.250 --> 00:01:45.375
will illuminate the subject of devotion in full.

31
00:01:50.291 --> 00:01:52.958
Arjun asks, 'O Lord Krishna,

32
00:01:52.958 --> 00:01:54.500
some yogis steadfastly

33
00:01:54.500 --> 00:01:57.416
worship Your personal form,

34
00:01:57.416 --> 00:02:01.541
and others contemplate Your formless Brahman.

35
00:02:01.541 --> 00:02:04.250
Which of these two is superior?'

36
00:02:04.250 --> 00:02:05.250
This question

37
00:02:05.250 --> 00:02:06.708
brings two main spiritual

38
00:02:06.708 --> 00:02:09.083
paths to light.

39
00:02:09.083 --> 00:02:13.166
One is the path of devotion,
where through love, surrender,

40
00:02:13.166 --> 00:02:17.208
and service, one remembers
and worships the personal form

41
00:02:17.208 --> 00:02:19.041
of the Lord.

42
00:02:19.041 --> 00:02:21.375
The other is the path of knowledge,

43
00:02:21.375 --> 00:02:24.166
where one transcends individual existence

44
00:02:24.166 --> 00:02:27.666
and meditates deeply on the formless Supreme

45
00:02:27.666 --> 00:02:32.458
and tries to merge into that formless truth.

46
00:02:32.458 --> 00:02:35.458
Arjun's question is not merely philosophical,

47
00:02:35.458 --> 00:02:38.041
it is deeply practical.

48
00:02:38.041 --> 00:02:39.875
He has already seen Lord Krishna's divine,

49
00:02:39.875 --> 00:02:42.166
cosmic form.

50
00:02:42.166 --> 00:02:45.208
Yet his heart is drawn toward Lord Krishna's

51
00:02:45.208 --> 00:02:49.041
personal form, full of sweetness and intimacy.

52
00:02:49.041 --> 00:02:53.208
But as mentioned in Chapter 9,

53
00:02:53.208 --> 00:02:56.458
Arjun has also come to know from Lord Krishna

54
00:02:56.458 --> 00:02:58.625
that people follow many paths

55
00:02:58.625 --> 00:03:00.958
to reach the supreme truth.

56
00:03:00.958 --> 00:03:03.625
So now Arjun, without any
remaining doubt in his mind,

57
00:03:03.625 --> 00:03:06.541
wants a clear answer: which path,

58
00:03:06.541 --> 00:03:09.208
devotion to the formless or to the personal form,

59
00:03:09.208 --> 00:03:10.833
is meaningful.

60
00:03:10.833 --> 00:03:12.083
And it is this question

61
00:03:12.083 --> 00:03:15.875
that will give direction to Chapter 12,

62
00:03:15.875 --> 00:03:17.750
where Lord Krishna will explain

63
00:03:17.750 --> 00:03:20.666
that far deeper than fixing the mind

64
00:03:20.666 --> 00:03:24.833
on the formless is devotion to the personal form,

65
00:03:24.833 --> 00:03:28.416
and the path of devotion is supreme.

66
00:03:32.750 --> 00:03:34.916
Here Arjun

67
00:03:34.916 --> 00:03:37.875
is asking a very clear

68
00:03:37.875 --> 00:03:41.666
and deep question.

69
00:03:41.666 --> 00:03:46.750
When there is true surrender within a person,

70
00:03:46.750 --> 00:03:49.333
they are not satisfied

71
00:03:49.333 --> 00:03:52.916
with surface-level things.

72
00:03:52.916 --> 00:03:56.958
They want to reach the root of every matter.

73
00:03:56.958 --> 00:04:02.250
Arjun's question is not a show,

74
00:04:02.250 --> 00:04:07.333
nor an attempt to impress Me.

75
00:04:07.333 --> 00:04:08.875
Rather,

76
00:04:08.875 --> 00:04:11.041
it is proof of a seeker's

77
00:04:11.041 --> 00:04:14.125
thoughtfulness

78
00:04:14.125 --> 00:04:17.875
and thirst,

79
00:04:17.875 --> 00:04:20.083
of which path

80
00:04:20.083 --> 00:04:23.375
will lead them to the supreme truth.

81
00:04:23.375 --> 00:04:25.375
In life,

82
00:04:25.375 --> 00:04:28.083
your questions

83
00:04:28.083 --> 00:04:31.250
reveal the depth of your thinking

84
00:04:31.250 --> 00:04:34.958
and the firmness of your purpose.

85
00:04:34.958 --> 00:04:37.916
Those whose purpose is clear

86
00:04:37.916 --> 00:04:41.875
ask deeper questions.

87
00:04:41.875 --> 00:04:46.041
And where the purpose is unclear,

88
00:04:46.041 --> 00:04:48.125
the questions too

89
00:04:48.125 --> 00:04:50.500
are half-formed.

90
00:04:50.500 --> 00:04:53.375
Often a person, satisfied

91
00:04:53.375 --> 00:04:56.500
by any answer,

92
00:04:56.500 --> 00:05:00.000
also does not ask questions

93
00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:06.000
out of fear that others may think them foolish.

94
00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:07.500
But

95
00:05:07.500 --> 00:05:10.583
those whose goal is clear

96
00:05:10.583 --> 00:05:15.000
try to understand every matter.

97
00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:18.416
They raise questions without hesitation,

98
00:05:18.416 --> 00:05:21.500
because their purpose

99
00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:26.041
is to receive knowledge and progress.

100
00:05:26.041 --> 00:05:29.000
A person often

101
00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:32.875
fears appearing ignorant

102
00:05:32.875 --> 00:05:35.458
more than being ignorant,

103
00:05:35.458 --> 00:05:37.583
and this very fear

104
00:05:37.583 --> 00:05:41.208
becomes a barrier to their progress.

105
00:05:41.208 --> 00:05:44.041
You are not like that, are you?

106
00:05:44.041 --> 00:05:45.958
If so,

107
00:05:45.958 --> 00:05:48.750
then change yourself.

108
00:05:48.750 --> 00:05:51.916
Erase the doubts from your mind,

109
00:05:51.916 --> 00:05:55.041
bring clarity to your life.

110
00:05:55.041 --> 00:05:59.416
Ask questions, seek their answers.

111
00:05:59.416 --> 00:06:03.041
Your goal will begin to appear clearly,

112
00:06:03.041 --> 00:06:05.458
and from this, personal

113
00:06:05.458 --> 00:06:07.166
progress will follow.

114
00:06:11.625 --> 00:06:13.750
A person,

115
00:06:13.750 --> 00:06:17.750
in social and family matters,

116
00:06:17.750 --> 00:06:20.875
often asks many questions.

117
00:06:20.875 --> 00:06:23.875
They look for the right path.

118
00:06:23.875 --> 00:06:25.750
Which school

119
00:06:25.750 --> 00:06:28.958
to enrol their child in,

120
00:06:28.958 --> 00:06:31.708
which profession to choose,

121
00:06:31.708 --> 00:06:33.750
where to buy a home,

122
00:06:33.750 --> 00:06:38.458
and there are many such
matters where a person

123
00:06:38.458 --> 00:06:40.833
thinks deeply,

124
00:06:40.833 --> 00:06:42.833
weighs options,

125
00:06:42.833 --> 00:06:46.166
and tries to make the right decision.

126
00:06:46.166 --> 00:06:48.000
But

127
00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:49.375
when it comes

128
00:06:49.375 --> 00:06:52.708
to spirituality,

129
00:06:52.708 --> 00:06:54.708
do you

130
00:06:54.708 --> 00:06:58.083
think with the same depth?

131
00:06:58.083 --> 00:07:00.750
Do you weigh every

132
00:07:00.750 --> 00:07:03.958
perspective of spirituality,

133
00:07:03.958 --> 00:07:07.333
and clear your doubts?

134
00:07:07.333 --> 00:07:11.750
Or do you simply follow
whatever tradition you received,

135
00:07:11.750 --> 00:07:13.708
whatever you heard from someone,

136
00:07:13.708 --> 00:07:15.208
or whatever seemed easy,

137
00:07:15.208 --> 00:07:18.750
without asking and without understanding?

138
00:07:18.750 --> 00:07:22.250
You simply begin to follow it.

139
00:07:22.250 --> 00:07:24.958
Look at Arjun.

140
00:07:24.958 --> 00:07:27.666
Before him

141
00:07:27.666 --> 00:07:31.375
I Myself am standing.

142
00:07:31.375 --> 00:07:35.458
He has even seen My cosmic form.

143
00:07:35.458 --> 00:07:37.041
But

144
00:07:37.041 --> 00:07:40.958
even now, if a question remains in his mind,

145
00:07:40.958 --> 00:07:43.541
he asks it.

146
00:07:43.541 --> 00:07:47.208
He wants clarity, which path

147
00:07:47.208 --> 00:07:51.375
is superior and why.

148
00:07:51.375 --> 00:07:53.458
And with every question,

149
00:07:53.458 --> 00:07:56.166
he keeps strengthening

150
00:07:56.166 --> 00:07:58.458
his resolve,

151
00:07:58.458 --> 00:08:00.625
because he does not want

152
00:08:00.625 --> 00:08:04.916
anything in his devotion to remain incomplete.

153
00:08:04.916 --> 00:08:08.666
You too, in the matter of spirituality,

154
00:08:08.666 --> 00:08:11.250
can go deep.

155
00:08:11.250 --> 00:08:15.708
You can ask questions
related to traditions and rituals.

156
00:08:15.708 --> 00:08:18.250
If you get no answer from anyone,

157
00:08:18.250 --> 00:08:22.458
then seek the answers to
those questions yourself.

158
00:08:22.458 --> 00:08:24.083
In today's age,

159
00:08:24.083 --> 00:08:27.166
every question has an answer available.

160
00:08:27.166 --> 00:08:31.333
All that is needed is curiosity,

161
00:08:31.333 --> 00:08:34.250
and a firm resolve for devotion.

162
00:08:34.250 --> 00:08:37.041
So ask questions.

163
00:08:37.041 --> 00:08:41.166
Understand spirituality deeply.

164
00:08:41.166 --> 00:08:44.583
Seek the company of teachers.

165
00:08:44.583 --> 00:08:47.750
Discuss with other seekers.

166
00:08:47.750 --> 00:08:50.333
Receive knowledge from them,

167
00:08:50.333 --> 00:08:52.750
and where you can,

168
00:08:52.750 --> 00:08:57.791
illuminate others with your knowledge too.

169
00:08:57.791 --> 00:08:59.875
Remember,

170
00:08:59.875 --> 00:09:01.916
true surrender

171
00:09:01.916 --> 00:09:04.333
is born only

172
00:09:04.333 --> 00:09:07.125
where there is deep understanding.

173
00:09:11.666 --> 00:09:13.791
Arjun's questions

174
00:09:13.791 --> 00:09:16.791
are not for show.

175
00:09:16.791 --> 00:09:19.375
The purpose behind his questions

176
00:09:19.375 --> 00:09:21.375
is clear.

177
00:09:21.375 --> 00:09:26.041
He wants to fully understand the matter

178
00:09:26.041 --> 00:09:29.666
and bring it into his life.

179
00:09:29.666 --> 00:09:34.791
If someone has a genuine desire to grow,

180
00:09:34.791 --> 00:09:37.166
that person is not satisfied

181
00:09:37.166 --> 00:09:41.250
with surface-level understanding alone.

182
00:09:41.250 --> 00:09:45.333
They try to go to the depth of every matter.

183
00:09:45.333 --> 00:09:47.250
They do not understand knowledge

184
00:09:47.250 --> 00:09:50.875
only at the intellectual level,

185
00:09:50.875 --> 00:09:54.666
but also put it into practice in life.

186
00:09:54.666 --> 00:09:59.125
The same applies in professional life.

187
00:09:59.125 --> 00:10:03.000
Your seriousness about change

188
00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:05.041
is reflected in your curiosity

189
00:10:05.041 --> 00:10:09.333
and in your questions.

190
00:10:09.333 --> 00:10:11.541
In a professional meeting,

191
00:10:11.541 --> 00:10:13.583
do you ask questions only

192
00:10:13.583 --> 00:10:16.541
to impress others,

193
00:10:16.541 --> 00:10:19.958
or truly to understand a subject

194
00:10:19.958 --> 00:10:22.166
deeply?

195
00:10:22.166 --> 00:10:26.666
Do you ask questions to find
fault with others,

196
00:10:26.666 --> 00:10:31.041
or genuinely to improve a plan?

197
00:10:31.041 --> 00:10:33.958
And regarding a plan

198
00:10:33.958 --> 00:10:35.666
you have made yourself,

199
00:10:35.666 --> 00:10:39.666
do you only expect praise?

200
00:10:39.666 --> 00:10:40.583
Or

201
00:10:40.583 --> 00:10:44.333
do you sincerely ask others for suggestions too,

202
00:10:44.333 --> 00:10:48.750
so that you can make the plan stronger?

203
00:10:48.750 --> 00:10:50.125
Think about it.

204
00:10:50.125 --> 00:10:54.000
In these questions and
the self-reflection related to them

205
00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:56.666
lies the key to professional success.

206
00:10:56.666 --> 00:11:00.541
True and lasting success will come

207
00:11:00.541 --> 00:11:02.958
when your thinking is clear,

208
00:11:02.958 --> 00:11:05.333
and your thinking will become clear

209
00:11:05.333 --> 00:11:09.250
when you, of yourself and of others,

210
00:11:09.250 --> 00:11:12.291
ask the right questions,

211
00:11:12.291 --> 00:11:14.625
for the answers to these very questions

212
00:11:14.625 --> 00:11:18.583
will also guide you in the right direction.
